-- consider dispatches on a record's shape --
  right: matched circle r2
-- consider reaches else when nothing matches --
  right: fell through to else
-- consider dispatches on an array --
  right: matched [1,2]
-- consider on a scalar is unchanged --
  right: matched look
-- a watcher agrees with the operator about what changed --
  FIRED
  assigning an EQUAL record (must not fire)
  assigning the same fields in another order (must not fire)
  assigning a DIFFERENT nested value (must fire)
  FIRED
  assigning a DIFFERENT shape (must fire)
  FIRED
  done
-- the same for an array --
  FIRED xs
  assigning an equal array (must not fire)
  assigning a longer array (must fire)
  FIRED xs
  done
